# uwsm compositor environment — sourced before Hyprland/aquamarine start.
# AQ_* MUST live here (not in hypr/env.conf `env=`), because aquamarine reads
# them at backend-creation, which is earlier than config `env=` application.

# Keep Aquamarine's default atomic KMS backend. Atomic connector properties are
# required for the AORUS HDR colorspace and HDR_OUTPUT_METADATA commits; setting
# AQ_NO_ATOMIC makes the SUPER+ALT+H hardware-HDR toggle impossible.
#
# AQ_NO_ATOMIC was added as an emergency workaround on 2026-07-03 after a
# vLLM/torch backfill starved the RTX 5090 and triggered failed page flips. The
# narrower mitigations remain: VRR is disabled below and vLLM has explicit SM
# and memory caps. Do not restore the legacy backend as a normal-session fix.
unset AQ_NO_ATOMIC

# Disable VRR/G-Sync at the NVIDIA GL-driver level. This retains the narrower
# page-flip stability guard while allowing atomic KMS and HDR. Trade-off: it
# also disables G-Sync in fullscreen games launched from this session.
export __GL_VRR_ALLOWED=0
